# `lib/` and `lib/types/` are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# This package is distributed through git (route A in PLUGIN_RELEASE_GUIDE.md):
# `dsh plugin add "github:..."` installs only the files git tracks, and the
# install performs no build step, so the compiled entry points and their type
# declarations must be committed. Ignoring `lib/types/` alone would create a
# half-released package that runs but hands TypeScript consumers no types.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
